# TEAM 1: code-review-team [HIERARCHICAL]
# Lead delegates to 4 specialists, aggregates, makes final call
name: code-review-team
title: "Code review team — 1 lead + 4 specialists (HIERARCHICAL)"
description: "Code review team — 1 lead + 4 specialists (HIERARCHICAL)"
version: 1.0.0

sub_recipes:
  - name: code-review-lead
