    description: "Team lead — delegates to 4 specialists"
  - name: code-review-style
    path: ../sub/code-review-style.yaml
    description: "Code style specialist — PEP8/formatting"
  - name: code-review-perf
    path: ../sub/code-review-perf.yaml
    description: "Performance specialist — algorithmic complexity"
  - name: code-review-correctness
    path: ../sub/code-review-correctness.yaml
    description: "Correctness specialist — logic bugs"
  - name: code-review-readability
    path: ../sub/code-review-readability.yaml
    description: "Readability specialist — naming/comments"

instructions: |
  This is the code review team (HIERARCHICAL architecture).
  The lead delegates review tasks to 4 specialists and aggregates results.
  Specialists: style, performance, correctness, readability.
  Use for: reviewing code quality, finding bugs, suggesting improvements.
